    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000015",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000014",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Fundación e Historia Antigua"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000017",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000016",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Fundada por San Pishoy en el siglo IV."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000019",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000018",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Los restos de Pishoy y Pablo de Tammah, enterrados originalmente en el monasterio de Pishoy, en Deir el-Bersha, fueron trasladados a este monasterio en el siglo IX."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000001b",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Desarrollos modernos "
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000001d",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "El monasterio alberga las reliquias de Pishoy, Pablo de Tammah y otros santos, y se dice que el cuerpo de Pishoy permanece incorrupto."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000022",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "El Papa Shenouda III de "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000020",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000001f"
       ],
       "text": "Alejandría"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000021",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", que ejerció de 1971 a 2012, también está enterrado aquí."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001f",
       "_type": "internalLink",
       "reference": {
        "_ref": "wp-page-88427",
        "_type": "reference"
       }
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000024",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000023",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Aspectos arquitectónicos destacados"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000028",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000025",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Contiene cinco iglesias, la principal dedicada a San Pishoy."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000026",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000027",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Otras iglesias están dedicadas a María, Abaskhiron el Soldado, San Jorge y el Arcángel Miguel."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000002d",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000029",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Cuenta "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000002b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000002a"
       ],
       "text": "con una torre del"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000002c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " homenaje protectora, construida inicialmente en el siglo V contra los ataques berberiscos, y un castillo moderno construido bajo el papa Shenouda III."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000002a",
       "_type": "internalLink",
       "reference": {
        "_ref": "wp-page-89438",
        "_type": "reference"
       }
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000002f",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000002e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "El Pozo de los Mártires "
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000036",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000030",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Un pozo histórico donde, según la tradición, los bereberes lavaron sus espadas tras matar a los Cuarenta y Nueve Ancianos Mártires de Scetes."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000031",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000032",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Los cuerpos de los mártires fueron posteriormente recuperados y enterrados en el cercano "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000034",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000033"
       ],
       "text": "Monasterio de San Macario el Grande"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000035",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000033",
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/es/guide/wadi-al-natron/monasterio-de-san-macario-el-grande",
       "newTab": false
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000038",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000037",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Acontecimientos recientes bajo el Papa Shenouda III "
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000003d",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000039",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Ampliación y modernización del monasterio, incluida la restauración de edificios antiguos, la construcción de nuevas instalaciones para monjes y "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000003b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000003a"
       ],
       "text": "visitantes"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000003c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", y el desarrollo de proyectos agrícolas y ganaderos."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000003a",
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/es/guide/beni-suef",
       "newTab": false
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000040",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000003e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Añade aquí el texto de tu encabezamientoPapas"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000003f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ],
       "text": "del Monasterio"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000043",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000041",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "En particular, el Papa Gabriel VIII (1525-1570) y el Papa Macario III (1942-1945) estuvieron asociados al Monasterio de San Pishoy."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000042",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "En 2015, el obispo y el abad eran Sarapamon (Serapis Amon)."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "number",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000004a",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000044",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "El Monasterio de San Pishoy se erige como símbolo de la perdurable fuerza y profundidad espiritual de la fe copta ortodoxa."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000045",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000046",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Su rica historia, unida a su papel permanente como centro de vida monástica y peregrinación, lo convierten en un lugar de gran importancia tanto para los creyentes como para los "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000048",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000047"
       ],
       "text": "historiadores"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000049",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000047",
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/es/blog/explorando-la-gran-esfinge-de-guiza",
       "newTab": false
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000004c",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000004b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Creado el 18 de marzo de 2020"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000004e",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
